    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20650c3283e005d4f1f2a45d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "巧克力的准备，每年都万无一失。\n多亏了『情人节锦标赛』，\n一到这个时期我就会想起来呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "02483913a4f8e2e880296405358fc75d95120529e40c6cd868925270c659a221",
